1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,018
Chapter 6. The open city.

2
00:00:03,318 --> 00:00:12,903
In the year 2000 came the PlayStation 2. Beyond games, it played DVDs, right as DVD became the standard for movies.

3
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:19,423
It sold over 160 million units: even today, it remains the best-selling console in history.

4
00:00:19,603 --> 00:00:27,150
And in October 2001, an Edinburgh studio released a game that changed the rules: Grand Theft Auto III.

5
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:34,953
An entire city, in 3D, where you could go anywhere you wanted. It was no longer a level. It was a world.

6
00:00:35,703 --> 00:00:38,420
Remember that name. It will return.
